operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements
input operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements requiresAuctionId Bool
input operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements hasAuctionId Bool
input operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements requiresIdempotencyKey Bool
input operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements hasIdempotencyKey Bool
input operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements requiresExpectedRevision Bool
input operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements hasExpectedRevision Bool
output operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements Int64
memory validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements heap no
async validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements no
purpose operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements "Validate route-param, idempotency, and expected-revision requirements before command-specific rule checks."
invariant operation validateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements "Route params are checked before idempotency so malformed dynamic URLs never consume idempotency keys."

label startValidateAuctionCommandRequestRequirements
branch if condition requiresAuctionId target checkAuctionIdPresent
jump target checkIdempotencyRequirement

label checkAuctionIdPresent
branch if condition hasAuctionId target checkIdempotencyRequirement
return value commandRejectMissingAuctionIdCode

label checkIdempotencyRequirement
branch if condition requiresIdempotencyKey target checkIdempotencyPresent
jump target checkExpectedRevisionRequirement

label checkIdempotencyPresent
branch if condition hasIdempotencyKey target checkExpectedRevisionRequirement
return value commandRejectMissingIdempotencyKeyCode

label checkExpectedRevisionRequirement
branch if condition requiresExpectedRevision target checkExpectedRevisionPresent
return value commandRejectNoneCode

label checkExpectedRevisionPresent
branch if condition hasExpectedRevision target acceptCommandRequestRequirements
return value commandRejectMissingExpectedRevisionCode

label acceptCommandRequestRequirements
return value commandRejectNoneCode

