argument actorIsBidderForCommandCall left Int32 actorRole
argument actorIsBidderForCommandCall right Int32 bidderUserRoleCode
run actorIsBidderForCommandCall
bind value actorIsBidderForCommand Bool actorIsBidderForCommandCall
branch if condition actorIsBidderForCommand target acceptAuctionCommandActor
return value commandRejectForbiddenCode

label validateAuctioneerCommandActor
call actorIsAuctioneerCall math.equalInt32
argument actorIsAuctioneerCall left Int32 actorRole
argument actorIsAuctioneerCall right Int32 auctioneerUserRoleCode
run actorIsAuctioneerCall
