branch if condition actorIsAuctioneer target acceptAuctionCommandActor
call actorIsAdminCall math.equalInt32
argument actorIsAdminCall left Int32 actorRole
argument actorIsAdminCall right Int32 adminUserRoleCode
run actorIsAdminCall
bind value actorIsAdmin Bool actorIsAdminCall
branch if condition actorIsAdmin target acceptAuctionCommandActor
return value commandRejectForbiddenCode

label acceptAuctionCommandActor
return value commandRejectNoneCode

operation validateAuctionPolicy
input operation validateAuctionPolicy minimumIncrement Int64
input operation validateAuctionPolicy startingBid Int64
input operation validateAuctionPolicy maxBidAmount Int64
input operation validateAuctionPolicy antiSnipingWindowMillis Int64
input operation validateAuctionPolicy antiSnipingExtensionMillis Int64
